  <name>InternationalObjects</name>
  <synonym>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>International objects</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>اشیای بین‌المللی</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Oggetti internazionali</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Obiekty międzynarodowe</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Объекты международные</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>Uluslararası nesneler</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Đối tượng quốc tế</value>
  </synonym>
  <explanation>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>Technological subsystem.
It includes objects which belong to the International configuration EM2, PA and TM11 only.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>زیرسیستم فناوری.
شامل اشیایی است که فقط به پیکربندی بین‌المللی EM2، PA و TM11 تعلق دارند.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Sottosistema tecnologico.
Include gli oggetti che appartengono solo alle configurazioni internazionali УП2, КА, УТ11.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Podsystem technologiczny.
Zawiera obiekty związane tylko z Międzynarodową konfiguracją UP2, KA, UT11.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Технологическая подсистема.
Включает в себя объекты, относящиеся только к Международной конфигурации УП2, КА, УТ11.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>Teknolojik alt sistem.
Sadece EM2, PA, TM11 Uluslararası konfigürasyonu ile ilgili nesneleri içerir.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Phân hệ công nghệ.
Bao gồm các đối tượng chỉ liên quan đến cấu hình quốc tế UP2, KA, UT11.</value>
  </explanation>
